1 'Vaitkus, Antanas' 2023-03-20T11:25:00+02:00
;
 Updated the summary chemical formula and the atom site type symbols to
 represent hydride anions as 'H-' instead of 'He'. This allows to correctly
 recognise them as hydrogen atoms instead of helium atoms.
;
